# Vibe coding

AI implements. The human (and ART_GUIDE.md) decides how it looks.

```
X  "예쁘게 만들어줘" / "polish this"
O  "1px bounce, 2 frames, palette only, no outline"
```

- Never generate gameplay sprites with a general image model. Edit `tools/gen_sprites.py`
- Never pick a new hex. If you need a color, map it to an existing role
- Build in the DESIGN.md order. Do not skip to content
- Keep juice pixel-perfect: freeze, squash, shake, integer particles
